      "value": "Duplicate:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/protonmail-email-addresess-cant-be-used\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/support-for-protonmail\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-proton-mail-as-compatible-email-domains\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/enable-proton-email-addresses",
