  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello! I have been recently migrating from Gmail to Proton Mail, but have been unable to move my VRChat account to my Proton address (ending with “proton.me”).\n\nThis seems to be a well-documented limitation for VRChat (https://ask.vrchat.com/t/vrchat-account-with-proton-me-email/20939, https://old.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/16toiqc/this_email_address_is_not_allowed_at_this_time/, https://steamcommunity.com/app/438100/discussions/6/600771932544124213/), but I wanted to put in this support ticket to bring more attention to it. I am asking if VRChat may please reconsider allowing users to register with Proton Mail addresses, as I have many privacy concerns with continuing to use Gmail (my messages being used for advertising, AI training, etc.)\n\nThank you for your time and attention!",
